# Allow-list for the API image (docker/Dockerfile): the build context is only what the image needs.
# Data, notebooks, MLflow state, reports, tests and .env never reach the Docker daemon.
# The interface image has its own list: docker/frontend.Dockerfile.dockerignore.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!params.yaml
!src/
!docker/requirements-api.txt
!artifacts/model.joblib
!artifacts/model_meta.json
!artifacts/rules.json
!artifacts/reference_profile.json
!artifacts/demo_customers.json
!artifacts/catalogue.json
!artifacts/index/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
src/*.egg-info
